        "notes": "I will be dividing this build into two sections (dive/poke). Dive will be showed as purchased while poke will be the optional items (Except powers) , this is because its easier to play against poke since its just full damage. \nFor the first round  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) &  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) are a must since they are the best value first round.\nFor the third item it will depend which comp you're playing against, If its Dive you should pick  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and if its ranged pick  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) as these increase the damage output of respective paths.\nAnd for the powers  [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) is for dive and  [Incendiary Rounds](item_0cff5b79-dd12-475a-aca1-24fd4e8b8491) is for poke.\nExtra:  [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) is a must if u play against genji, and  [Incendiary Rounds](item_0cff5b79-dd12-475a-aca1-24fd4e8b8491) could still be used if they only have a D.va.",
